<title>BELGIUM: Lonrho Continental 1995/96 net up 26 pct.</title>
<headline>Lonrho Continental 1995/96 net up 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the 12 months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated):</p>
<p>    Group net profit	    154.1  vs  122.4</p>
<p>    Net dividend(francs)*     123.0  vs   70.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Lonrho Continental (formerly known as Lonrho Belgium) is 82.5 percent owned by Lonrho Plc. *The company has already paid interim dividend of 48 Belgian francs. The balance to be paid following the annual shareholders meeting on February 18 is 75 francs net.</p>
</text>
